gqpq.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E9%94%A5%E6%9C%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/5k2morjimbp3e4u0shp0e2tqztngqpq.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E9%94%A5%E6%9C%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e2/5k2morjimbp3e4u0shp0e2tqztngqpq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />冰锥术\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）选择1个地点，对目标地点<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格范围内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">80%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰属性</font></span></span>][<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/79/i29swk39niyqh5cmz3afznuuaebly4e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.b